{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":158339,\"title\":\"Three Sisters\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Once upon a time in a beautiful yet mysterious country, there lived three sisters named Türkan, Dönüş, and Derya. As a close-knit family, they would dream of a promising future every night. Perhaps such an upbringing, that was similar to a fairy tale on the pine-scented streets of Ayvalık, had not prepared them for the grim reality of adulthood. Over time, the sisters discover that life and the choices that are accompanied by it are not as easy as they seem. Inconceivable secrets can be hidden even by those who are trusted the most and horrific illnesses can lead to the resurrection of the past. This leads them to the question: Is there anything in the world that time cannot heal?\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3kaHac8zpJykxVdXM6Fse3AYj9W.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gCLhbOZJaYv5HjKMU4aMntLMUQs.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6.8,\"voteCount\":10,\"year\":2022,\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":3,\"totalEpisodes\":84,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"Kanal D\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"TR\",\"name\":\"Turkey\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2024-05-04\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2380655,\"name\":\"Eda Teksöz\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1953639,\"name\":\"İclal Aydın\",\"character\":\"Nesrin\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uMGVUAcSAOfeKc40EdRZnRUkQSt.jpg\"},{\"id\":1109362,\"name\":\"Reha Özcan\",\"character\":\"Sadık\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gabSe1RiXKvCXy6X7amM9Y2cjue.jpg\"},{\"id\":1829150,\"name\":\"Almila Ada\",\"character\":\"Dönüş\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bXd8deX72g5XJG5mep3mmJqtVpP.jpg\"},{\"id\":1935666,\"name\":\"Berker Güven\",\"character\":\"Somer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7oROmKqz1Wr5JaYll5NcPzPztfX.jpg\"},{\"id\":1513948,\"name\":\"Benian Dönmez\",\"character\":\"Nezahat Kalender\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g2GBuyrOGTiEMnD3C93VvmKHwcq.jpg\"},{\"id\":2755808,\"name\":\"Nazlı Senem Ünal\",\"character\":\"Mine\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Ap7j8toM1xZQEww89wmPEJigAWE.jpg\"},{\"id\":1372946,\"name\":\"Hakan Atalay\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5ivj7W6frBCQ2J5YOsf3WcK235r.jpg\"},{\"id\":3458974,\"name\":\"Vural Şahanoğlu\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gEPb908qaQfGDMxstVQttZhwj6q.jpg\"},{\"id\":1985839,\"name\":\"Emre Kıvılcım\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k6RjYtWACMqh5Rzvfkm2bzQOhrm.jpg\"},{\"id\":1256380,\"name\":\"Veda Yurtsever\",\"character\":\"Rüçhan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sL6mehnVbf4FX3vwvZa1gvfTljO.jpg\"},{\"id\":2058369,\"name\":\"Serhan Süsler\",\"character\":\"Nihat\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AryjuWltOnHNCcubLia6cJOq4mO.jpg\"},{\"id\":1954011,\"name\":\"Özgü Kaya\",\"character\":\"Türkan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1gWd5zxYiefY5xu2avh5BPzcz4R.jpg\"},{\"id\":3505664,\"name\":\"Demircan Kaçel\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kvZxq44fZ0QO6hSZqFBPymNHhw6.jpg\"},{\"id\":3557953,\"name\":\"Melisa Berberoğlu\",\"character\":\"Derya\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4qmMSnFum4k5XA7Xt7nUBTNrn6j.jpg\"},{\"id\":3289116,\"name\":\"Murat Çidamlı\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p9b1iLdCKNwzhqBdp4S4aPiQz2G.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"EiiLf5vL7Ng\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"W3vnIbGkYpw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"sia9iG183cE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Season 2\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aBegE1HkXNynpiVaXJQi2qOykhx.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2022-09-13\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 17\",\"overview\":\"The fact that Mine gave birth to Somer's baby affects the love life of Somer and Türkan, which is in full swing. Mine's plan is to regain Somer's heart and her life with her baby. When Nihat tries to harm Mine for the sake of the baby, Somer has to adopt Mine and her baby. When Nesrin starts to mentally journey through the traumas she has experienced in her past about Dönüş, the whole family mobilizes around Nesrin. As Derya learned from Fatih, she thinks that Fatih is her own father, while on the other hand, she is on the verge of starting a new life. Serdar and Derya earned the department they wanted at the university. This dream of learning cannot be accompanied by a single Return. Özer has to face the son he once abandoned. Özer's son, Mustafa Korman, comes to Ayvalık. Will Somer take care of Mine and her baby? Will Nesrin's trauma cause Return to learn the truth about her mother? Will Mustafa be able to get what he demands from his father Özer?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-13\",\"runtime\":153},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 18\",\"overview\":\"Somer brings Mine, who is exposed to Nihat's bad behavior, to her mother's house in order to protect her baby. Türkan and Mine start to live under the same roof. Unaware of everything, Türkan welcomes Mine and her baby with love. The presence of baby Kiraz activates Türkan's feelings of motherhood. Derya continues her aggressive actions because she believes that Fatih is her father. She gets into trouble in Izmir and asks Hakan for help. As Nesrin wanders through the dark waters of the past in her mind, the whole family, on the advice of a doctor, tries to do things that will make Nesrin feel good. After all the bad events that have passed, the whole family decides to go on a picnic. During a game played by young people at a picnic, Derya doubts that Hakan will leave her. Nihat does his best to find Mine and gets help from Fatih in this regard. Will Nihat find Mine? Will Mine be able to survive in Somer and Türkan's house?Will Nesin be able to recover from the traumas of the past?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-20\",\"runtime\":151},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 19\",\"overview\":\"Nihat learns that Mine is staying at Somer's house and comes to the house accompanied by the police to pick up Mine and Kiraz. The fact that Somer is taken to the police station creates anxiety on the Rüçhan and Türkan fronts. Mine begins to use her victimhood and the presence of her baby to spend time with Somer. This situation is met with suspicion by Türkan. Rüçhan blames Türkan for what happened to Somer. The trauma that Nesrin experienced, which caused her to forget many things, gradually leaves its place to remembering. As Nesrin begins to question her life again, she confronts the events that brought her to this point one by one. While Derya dreams of leaving her home and even her country to go to Canada with Hakan, Sadık learns about her daughter's intention to live abroad. Will Nihat be able to realize his plans to reunite with Mine? What situations will Nesin face as she returns to life? Will Hakan be able to keep the promise he made to Derya to live abroad?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-27\",\"runtime\":138},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 20\",\"overview\":\"Nesrin, who catches Rüçhan abusing violence on Türkan, takes Türkan away from her and takes her to her father's house without listening to Rüçhan. Although Somer wants to take Türkan and bring her to his side, Nesrin does not allow it. In order to convince her mother, Türkan says that she loves Somer and that her troubled days with Ms. Rüçhan are over. After a long time, Nesrin's memory comes back and fills the family with joy. Serdar and Dönüş can't stand the depression that Derya feels after Hakan's departure and claim that she is Fatih's daughter, are caught between the truth and sweet lies. Rüçhan is disturbed by Mustafa's presence and questions why Mustafa is in Ayvalık. Özer reunites with Sevilay, the mother of his son Mustafa and his love from years ago. Will Türkan and Somer be able to meet despite the obstacles between them? Will Derya be able to mend her heart broken by Hakan's departure? Will Rüçhan be able to justify himself against Türkan and Nesrin?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-04\",\"runtime\":141},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 21\",\"overview\":\"Nesrin learns that Mine lives with her baby in the same house with Türkan and does not want to send her home. Somer and Nesrin, who came to take Türkan to her mother's house, have a showdown. Türkan, who witnessed this fight, tells her mother that she is pregnant. While Rüçhan tries to keep all of Mine's movements under control, Türkan, who is in the first days of her pregnancy, approaches Mine. The families decide to dine together and celebrate the birth of their grandchild. Somer gives an enormous gift the his wife Türkan as a pregnancy gift. They decide to hide Türkan's pregnancy within the family. Rüçhan's plan is to send Mine away from home and live with Türkan and Somer. Derya overcomes the sadness she experienced after Hakan's departure with the presence of her sisters and Serdar. Will Mine leave Somer and Türkan's house? Will Rüçhan be able to keep Türkan in his own house as he wishes? Will Somer and Türkan be able to experience the happiness of their newborn baby?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-11\",\"runtime\":157},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 22\",\"overview\":\"Türkan hears Somer and Mine talking. She learns that Kiraz is Somer's baby. It's very difficult for Türkan to face this reality. Türkan move away from home to absorb what he hears on his own. While Türkan is struggling with the emotions she is trying to digest, she comes across Sevilay. Somer realizes that Türkan has distanced herself from him, but attributes this to Türkan's pregnancy and her indecision about having a child. Somer shares this feeling with Rüçhan. Despite his anger towards Türkan, Rüçhan approaches Türkan with sympathy and tells her a lie, \\\"I will have grandchildren for the first time\\\". Türkan begins to question not only Somer, but also Somer's family. Nesrin and Türkan confront Somer. Nesrin reminds Türkan that taking her belongings and returning to her father's house is also an option. In order to make Türkan happy, Somer surprises her and offers to take a vacation. Will Türkan go to her mother's house or will she choose to stay with Somer and raise her child?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-18\",\"runtime\":141},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 23\",\"overview\":\"When Türkan is torn between her mother and Somer, she chooses Somer. Türkan's intention is to confront Somer for everything she has heard about Mine. Türkan corners Somer to pour herself out. Somer attributes these states of Türkan to her pregnancy. Ultimately, Türkan and Somer confront Türkan's insistence. Curious about the absence of Somer and Türkan, Mine investigates where they are. Mine learns that her baby Kiraz will be taken away by Somer and Rüçhan after weaning. When Rüçhan confirms, Mine takes the baby and disappears. Rüçhan and Özer go after the baby. Having met his love Sevilay years ago, Özer, with a sense of guilt, intends to reconcile his son Mustafa and his ex-girlfriend Sevilay. Özer brings Mustafa and Sevilay together. Özer is happy with this decision, although he cannot show it. Derya starts her university life in Izmir with surprises and meets her high school friend Canan again. In the school corridors, she meets an interesting faculty member by chance.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-25\",\"runtime\":142},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 24\",\"overview\":\"Türkan finds a way out of the vortex of lies he has fallen into with Somer and Mine by confronting them. But instead of being honest, Mine lies when the three of them are together in order to get Somer back, implying that her relationship with Somer is still ongoing. Nesrin is worried about sending her daughter, Türkan, with Somer. While Nesrin shares her feelings with Nezahat, they hide the turmoil experienced by Türkan and Somer from Sadık. Mine's love for Somer causes great trouble when she throws herself from the balcony. While Somer and Türkan accused of attempting to destroy Mine's life, Rüçhan takes care of Mine, who is left unattended in the hospital and Türkan takes care of Mine's baby, Kiraz. Türkan makes a final decision about her marriage and the baby in her womb. Fatih tries to figure out which of Derya and Dönüş's daughter is his daughter. Serdar and Derya go to visit Dönüş, who has started working in Korman Olives. During this visit, young people meet Mustafa.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-01\",\"runtime\":139},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 25\",\"overview\":\"Türkan learns that Mine is the reason why she and Ferit hit the press. When Türkan realizes that Mine has been under the plots, she decides to stay with the Kormans by confronting her family. Sadık can't digest the situations that Nesrin knows about Türkan and leaves the house. For Sadık leaving the house, Dönüş and Derya blame Türkan for choosing to stay with Somer's uncles. Derya's lashing out causes a rift between Türkan and Derya. While Türkan is indecisive about the baby in her womb, Somer tries to convince Türkan of his love. After Mine's harsh threats, Rüçhan is forced to beg Türkan for her son's future. While Mine tries to get Türkan and Rüçhan to make her wishes through her statement to the police, she insists on her love for Somer and Somer learns about Mine's plots. Will Mine be able to make the Kormans do her wishes? Will Türkan set sail for a future with Somer? Will Sadık and Nesin be able to reconcile?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-08\",\"runtime\":140},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 26\",\"overview\":\"When Mine returns home as a result of the deal she made with Rüçhan, they have a big showdown with Türkan. While Türkan challenges Mine to continue her presence in that house, Mine reconsiders her statement to the police in the face of this unexpected attitude. This situation makes Rüçhan even more difficult. She tells Mine that Türkan will leave the house after a while to keep her calm. Somer and Türkan, on the other hand, begin to act together on Mine. Somer has to act calmly and cautiously towards Mine for the custody of Kiraz. On the other hand, Türkan tries to correct her resentment with her mother, but she is faced with Nesrin's harsh attitude. While the tension between Sadık and Nesrin continues, Nezahat and Hikmet's efforts to reconcile them are inconclusive. Sadık also leaves Nezahat's house. Mine does her best to hurt Türkan until the day she will testify. She embarks on a sneaky plan to harm Türkan and her baby.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-15\",\"runtime\":138},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Episode 27\",\"overview\":\"After losing her baby, Türkan experiences great pain and destruction. When she returns home, she shouts to the whole family that Mine intentionally left her to die. However, Mine manages to defend herself against Rüçhan and Somer. While the war between the two women continues, Rüçhan doesn't let go of this business. The loss of Türkan's baby makes Sadık more angry with Nesrin. After the loss of this baby, who will be a bridge with his daughter, Sadık, who is in deep hope of grandchildren, reunites with Nesrin. He blames Nesrin as responsible for all this. Nesrin then goes to visit Türkan. The gap between mother and daughter widens. Türkan goes crazy over Mine's manipulations and tensions arise between her and Somer. While increases his closeness with the girls and Somer, Mustafa taking action to shoot Somer and Özer in the heartland. Rüçhan makes it clear that Mine was referring to Türkan's baby. While attacking Mine on this issue, Türkan's approach is harsher than expected.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-22\",\"runtime\":140},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Episode 28\",\"overview\":\"Türkan sets up a little game with Somer in order to account for the painful loss she has experienced and to make Mine pay for what she has done one by one. Her aim is to make Mine confess her crime and send her to jail. On the other hand, Mesut, who hits the road after learning that his mother and father are dead, causes Sadık and Nesrin to face a reality they never considered. Nesrin is forced to choose between her pride and her family.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-29\",\"runtime\":142},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Episode 29\",\"overview\":\"After Türkan and Somer send Mine to prison, they begin to heal each other's wounds. Now they are even more hopeful for their future. However, Türkan learns about the possibility of not being a mother again and is devastated. While taking care of her husband's baby, she is also preparing to start working life... The identity of Türkan's partner will put Rüçhan and Özer Korman on an irreversible path. On the other hand, Mine, who cannot stomach being defeated by Türkan, causes a new crisis between Somer and Türkan.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-06\",\"runtime\":141},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Episode 30\",\"overview\":\"Somer accepts Mine's request to meet in order not to jeopardize Kiraz's custody. In exchange for the withdrawal of the complaint, Mine promises Somer that she will relinquish custody of the child. Somer is forced to hide this agreement from Türkan. Nesrin goes to Izmir with her daughters to protect Dönüş from Fatih. She is determined to divorce Sadık. Their departure to İzmir causes Dönüş and Serdar to face off and the truth is revealed. Türkan, who is unaware of Mine and Somer's custody agreement, continues to pressure Somer not to withdraw the complaint. This situation; brings Türkan and Rüçhan face to face. Rüçhan confronts Sevilay on the pretext that Türkan and Sevilay will work together. Türkan learns Somer's deal with Mine. There is great tension between them. Somer is determined not to leave Kiraz to Mine. This time, however, Türkan intervenes in this situation in order to protect Somer. This would be the beginning of a new crisis between Somer and Türkan.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-13\",\"runtime\":139},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Episode 31\",\"overview\":\"Türkan can't tell Somer that she delivered Kiraz to Mine. Somer's concern for his daughter leads Türkan to a great remorse. Nesrin and Nezahat don't leave Türkan alone in this situation. Rüçhan, Somer and the lawyers learn that the police didn't hand over Kiraz to Mine. As they try to find out who did it, Somer suspicious of his mother. Rüçhan also begins to feel suspicious of Türkan. This causes a new tension between Türkan and Rüçhan. Mine crosses paths with Mustafa on the way to the hospital after Kiraz suddenly falls ill. Thanks to Mustafa, Somer learns that his daughter is sick. While the waters will calm down and reconciliation will be achieved between Sadık and Nesrin, Fatih comes to Sadık's house with a new crisis. Sevilay and Türkan sign the employment contract despite Rüçhan's harsh conditions. Türkan is cornered after Kiraz gets sick and regrets giving the child to Mine. If Somer learns that it was Türkan who delivered his daughter to Mine, she knows that the end has come.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-20\",\"runtime\":140},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Episode 32\",\"overview\":\"Somer is disappointed to learn that it was Türkan who delivered Kiraz to Mine. A great confrontation takes place between the two. These tensions between Türkan and Somer also cause problems between Rüçhan and Türkan. While Sadık and Nesrin have decided to reconcile, Fatih's desperation puts the Kalender family in a new predicament. While Mustafa and Derya's friendship moves towards love, Sevilay's appearance in the Korman family pushes Özer into a corner. Sevilay stands behind his decisions, despite Özer. On the other hand, Rüçhan starts to take bigger steps in this regard. Unable to reach Mine, Somer comes to the point of breaking his ropes with Türkan. Türkan makes a decision after these events. For the Korman and Kalender family, the New Year's Eve celebration causes unexpected encounters.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-27\",\"runtime\":164},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Episode 33\",\"overview\":\"While Türkan goes to Somer to redeem herself, Mine takes advantage of Somer's breakup with Türkan and takes the road to the forest house where Somer is staying. Rüçhan experiences a great shock when he sees Sevilay and Mustafa in the house of the Nesrins. While Türkan cannot make sense of Mine's confronting Somer, Mine is also uneasy to see Türkan in front of her again. She looks for ways to gain the trust of Somer without separating him from his daughter. Nesrin's suspicions about Sevilay and Özer gradually increase. Serdar realizes that Dönen is chasing something secretly and follows him. Rüçhan brings Özer and Sevilay together and starts to operate his new plan. On the other hand, Mustafa decides to confront the Korman family, who put pressure on his mother. This decision brings Türkan and Somer to the brink of a new crisis.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-03\",\"runtime\":166},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Episode 34\",\"overview\":\"Hearing Mustafa's conversation with Ürkan, Somer has a tough confrontation with Mustafa. Having met Türkan before, Mustafa tells his father Özer what happened. As the ice melts between Mustafa and Özer after this issue is revealed, Rüçhan gets to know more about Mustafa and Sevilay. Türkan warns Derya about Mustafa. He has to decide between Somer's anger and Sevilay's situation. Between Donus and Serdar, the ropes are tense because of Fatih Kalender. Türkan and Sevilay's business partnership starts to worry Nesrin as well. Rüçhan, on the other hand, pushes Özer into a corner with the conditions he offers. While Somer's threats to Mustafa continue, Türkan comes face to face with Sevilay about Mustafa. While Rüçhan pressures Türkan to end his partnership, Türkan, who realizes that she knows everything, challenges Rüçhan.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-10\",\"runtime\":160},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Episode 35\",\"overview\":\"Türkan cannot forgive Rüçhan's willingness to turn a blind eye to the partnership, knowing Sevilay's position. Despite Somer, she remains more determined about Sevilay. Mine tries to improve her relationship with Somer and Rüçhan through Kiraz. The fact that Türkan's treatment begins to give results will be a ray of hope for Somer and Türkan to become a mother again. Rüçhan and Sevilay come face to face for the first time. Nesrin and Sadik are determined to prevent Return from becoming a donor. They decide to talk to Fatih's doctor about this issue. Fatih's daughter has already set off from Germany to Turkey. Türkan has to tell Somer that Sevilay is Mustafa's mother, their new order brings Türkan to the brink of a difficult decision. While the ice has melted between Özer and Mustafa, Özer makes a big attempt to win over his son Mustafa. When Rüçhan realizes that he cannot control Türkan regarding Sevilay, he attempts to hurt her in different ways.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-17\",\"runtime\":162},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Episode 36\",\"overview\":\"While Rüçhan thinks that she has won a great victory against Türkan with her game, she is shaken by a dangerous surprise waiting for her. Moreover, Türkan stands upright against Rüçhan's games and signals that he will not be defeated. The arrival of Fatih's daughter from Germany creates sadness in the house on the one hand and joy on the other. Despite her relentless illness, the young girl brought joy to the house, thanks to which the whole Kalender Family came together. However, Dönin's insistence on being a donor always leaves Nesrin and Sadık together. On one side are his own daughters, and on the other, an innocent young girl. Their biggest battle is now with their conscience. Türkan tries to end her partnership with Sevilay without breaking her relationship with Somer, but Somer is determined to find out who Mustafa's mother is. Rüçhan's latest plan, who has sworn to defeat Türkan, will confront Türkan and Somer again, and this time the ropes will be tenser than expected.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-24\",\"runtime\":164},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Episode 37\",\"overview\":\"Thinking that Türkan is hiding the truth about Sevilay on purpose, Somer angrily utters irreparable words and takes his frustrations elsewhere with her daughter and Rüçhan. When Rüçhan takes his son to her side, she does not hesitate to take advantage of this opportunity and continues to set Somer against Türkan. Derya and Mustafa get closer. As Derya stands behind her relationship despite everyone and everything, the tension in the Kalender Family grows. In the end, Nesrin has to face Mustafa and Sevilay. While Türkan tries to win him back despite all the distance of Somer, he also comes face to face with his mother about Sevilay. Rüçhan goes to Nesrin to talk about the latest. However, with a development, thanks to Mesut, Rüçhan and Nesrin's relationship becomes pregnant with surprises. While Türkan is holding on to a very good reason to get out of the darkness she is in, all of Türkan's hopes are destroyed when Somer is in the wrong time and place.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-31\",\"runtime\":165},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Episode 38\",\"overview\":\"While the tension between Türkan and Somer gradually increases, the fact that Özer is on his deathbed as a result of the attack increases the distance between them. While Derya and Mustafa make radical decisions about their new lives, they are unaware of the bad surprise waiting for them. Moreover, Derya is moving away from her family step by step for the sake of Mustafa. Rüçhan and Sevilay come face to face again about Özer. However, Rüçhan has no intention of letting Sevilay pass even when Özer is in such a serious situation. While Türkan is doing her best to support Somer in the hospital and also to make her forgive herself, Somer continues to smack Türkan's past mistakes one by one. Thus, he grows his anger towards Türkan even more and clarifies his distant attitude toward her. Türkan, on the other hand, comes to the point of making a new decision about her relationship with Somer, with a moment she witnessed.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-02-21\",\"runtime\":161},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Episode 39\",\"overview\":\"While Türkan is trying to build a new life for herself, Somer feels abandoned by her move. However, Türkan is determined. Despite everyone and everything, she will stand on her own feet from now on and live in the little world she will build. While Somer loses Türkan, on the other hand, he starts to win over his brother Mustafa. But Derya's taking shelter next to Mustafa brings the two families into serious confrontation. While Nesrin's tolerance for Sevilay gradually decreases, Sevilay hardens her attitude after all she has been through. As Türkan builds a new life, she confronts not only Somer, but also Nesrin and Sadık. First, Derya and then Türkan's escape from home put Sadık and Nesrin to the test. However, with a step taken by Rüçhan, Sadık and Nesrin will relax a bit. Türkan succumbs to her conscience and decides to take a positive step towards Somer, but she is unaware of the surprise development that awaits her.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-02-28\",\"runtime\":146},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Episode 40\",\"overview\":\"Seeing the news in the newspaper, Türkan decides that she has nothing left to fight for her marriage and takes action to divorce. However, Somer, who learns that Türkan is pregnant, has no intention of giving up on her marriage or his baby. Hearing Rüçhan's plans about Mustafa and Derya, Sevilay goes crazy and starts to call everyone to account. However, all doors, including Özer, are closed in his face one by one. Rüçhan thus begins to make new plans for Türkan, this time after taking revenge for the past from Sevilay. But on the other hand, a situation that he thinks is under his control is waiting for him, ready to explode like a bomb under the table. While Somer believes that he can fix everything at some point with his love for Türkan, no matter what happens, now it's his turn to face the mistakes he made in the past.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-03-07\",\"runtime\":149},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"Episode 41\",\"overview\":\"Somer takes action with clearer steps to regain Türkan. Türkan, on the other hand, is confronted with more and more difficulties in her new life that she is trying to establish, and she is unaware that these are just the beginning. Rüçhan also does his best to complicate Türkan's life. While Somer tries to fix everything, Mine continues to remind him that he stands like a dark shadow in the middle of the two. Somer can't stand it anymore and confronts Mine harshly. However, what Mine says and what Somer faces will continue to confuse Turkan, albeit unintentionally. Despite all this, while the possibility of Türkan and Somer's reconciliation continues to stand on the sidelines, the stones will be moved by the trap set by Rüçhan, and Somer's last move will be the biggest proof that he will not give up on Türkan despite everyone and everything.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-03-14\",\"runtime\":150},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"Episode 42\",\"overview\":\"Somer's purchase of the restaurant is also not enough to convince Türkan to reconcile. As Türkan continues her stubborn attitude, Somer's patience begins to run out. Mustafa and Derya, on the other hand, come to a crossroads again after Sevilay's suicide attempt. With Fatih's settlement in the Kalenders' house, Nesrin's whole order is turned upside down and Nesrin takes a new decision about Fatih. The fact that Rüçhan is at the police station brings Somer and Türkan, who are offended by each other, together again, and Türkan does not leave Somer alone throughout this process. Rüçhan, on the other hand, is unaware that he will be tested with much harsher ones while he is given one of the biggest tests of his life.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-03-21\",\"runtime\":145},{\"number\":27,\"name\":\"Episode 43\",\"overview\":\"Somer, who learns that his mother has been kicked out of the house, confronts Özer harshly, thinking that he has been waiting for this opportunity for years. While Nesrin continues to be accused by Rüçhan of giving the footage to the police, she also finds Somer in front of her. Somer blames Nesrin for this issue, just like her mother. Nesrin, on the other hand, cannot even convince Türkan of her innocence. Derya, thinking that Sevilay is behind their separation with Mustafa, takes her breath away at her door to confront him. However, Sevilay, who is very afraid of losing her son, has no idea how dark her eyes are. Türkan clearly understands that she does not want to lose Somer anymore, and this time she tries her best to reconcile. Somer, on the other hand, closes the doors to Türkan in a very difficult way after what his mother has gone through. However, a surprise proposal by Rüçhan to Türkan is capable of changing the course of everything.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-03-28\",\"runtime\":149},{\"number\":28,\"name\":\"Episode 44\",\"overview\":\"Türkan reconsiders after Rüçhan's proposal and decides to give her marriage another chance. After what Nesrin heard from Özer about the images, she confronts Türkan and Rüçhan and explains the facts one by one. Priority's world almost collapses on him. Sevilay, on the other hand, takes dangerous steps to consolidate her place next to Özer, taking advantage of Rüçhan's absence. Somer, on the one hand, seeks a solution to his mother's problems, on the other hand, tries to put his relationship with Türkan back in order. But this time, the running and chasing parties will change. When Türkan shares knowledge he learned with Somer, Somer's eyes turn and he takes his breath away with his father. While Somer fights to the end to take back everything Özer took from Rüçhan, the real surprise awaits Rüçhan.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-04-04\",\"runtime\":140},{\"number\":29,\"name\":\"Episode 45\",\"overview\":\"While Türkan is trying to save herself from the dangerous situation she is in, an unexpected surprise guest rushes to help Türkan. Rüçhan, on the other hand, takes action to restore order after seeing Sevilay in his own home. A development about Mesut causes emotional moments in the Kalender Family. While Türkan is afraid of being alone after her fearful moments, her movements gradually begin to attract Somer's attention. On the side of the duo, there is also excited anticipation for their baby. When Mustafa realizes that he cannot stay away from Derya, he takes radical steps. As the relationship between Dön and Serdar evolves into a different path, Döner begins to step toward the big secret about himself. The exams that Türkan will give while trying to stand on her own feet will continue to test her.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-04-11\",\"runtime\":146},{\"number\":30,\"name\":\"Episode 46\",\"overview\":\"When Somer learns of Türkan's attack, he immediately goes to Türkan's house to protect her. As the two spend time together, they can't stand it and surrender to their love. Dönüş falls into a serious dilemma with the unanswered questions in her mind and her experiences with Serdar. While Derya and Mustafa take secret and fast steps to get married, the lies that Dönüş will have to tell her family for this reason gradually increase. As the tension between Somer and Nesrin continues to rise, Türkan is caught between the two. Although Türkan seems to be caught in the wind of love with Somer's arrival and seems to have forgotten the bad memories of the past, a piece of information that Nezahat will learn will change the course of events, and dark clouds will fall over the fairy tale that Türkan and Somer live in.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-04-18\",\"runtime\":143},{\"number\":31,\"name\":\"Episode 47\",\"overview\":\"With Somer's visit to Mine, a new ray of hope is born in Mine's heart. Mine is determined not to lose Somer this time and takes steps as if Türkan had never entered their lives. Rüçhan, on the other hand, takes Türkan under his wing. Dönüş decides to pursue her own past and find the answers to her questions herself. Although Türkan and Somer are very angry with each other as a result of misunderstandings, they are forced to come together again because of Derya and Mustafa. The reckoning between them leads to very harsh confrontations. Sevilay's lie to Özer about her illness drops like a bomb in the lap of someone unexpected. Derya's secret wedding brings the three sisters face to face. As the supposedly unbreakable bond between them is strained day by day, their sisterhood will be put to the test.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-04-25\",\"runtime\":139},{\"number\":32,\"name\":\"Episode 48\",\"overview\":\"Somer takes all the blame for the photos in Türkan's possession in order not to give Rüçhan away. Both Somer and Türkan are victims of a misunderstanding to which they are no longer a party. Derya suddenly finds herself in Sevilay's house after an argument in the dormitory. As the tension between Derya and Sevilay escalates, Derya meets a completely different Mustafa. As if she has no life of her own, she takes on the problems of everyone in the house and starts to live their lives. For this reason, a distance is growing between her and Serdar that he has not yet realized. When Sadık learns that Dönüş is investigating the past, he finds a way to distract her from this subject, but he cannot calculate where the road will lead. Rüçhan takes a step to convince Türkan and Somer to reverse their decision to divorce. With Rüçhan's step, there are emotional moments on both sides, and the fate of both of them now depends on the answer they will give to the question asked by the judge.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-05-02\",\"runtime\":144},{\"number\":33,\"name\":\"Episode 49\",\"overview\":\"The end of the road has come for Türkan and Somer, the judge decides on their divorce. However, Türkan will continue to work at the company because of her promise to Rüçhan. As Rüçhan embraces Türkan, the distance between Türkan and her family grows and the wounds open deeper. Derya loses her patience with Mustafa's last act and leaves the house. With Derya's plan to teach Mustafa a lesson, Mustafa becomes confused about Derya. Dönüş, on the other hand, is unaware that a huge past lies behind a small key she will find by chance. Continuing to work at the same company despite their divorce is very difficult for both Türkan and Somer. However, Rüçhan's plans to bring them back together are not over yet. Rüçhan sends Türkan to the fair, supposedly to rest her head and learn the business. Although Rüçhan thinks that his plans are working perfectly, he has actually opened the door to Türkan's new life with his own hands with this move.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-05-09\",\"runtime\":149},{\"number\":34,\"name\":\"Episode 50\",\"overview\":\"Türkan and Somer run into each other at the hotel they go to for the fair and meet Kartal in an unfortunate way at the same time. Derya and Mustafa try to build a new life for themselves, unaware of the game Sevilay is playing behind their backs. Dönüş is getting closer and closer to her past and who she really is. When Rüçhan learns that Kartal is also at the fair, Rüçhan finally makes an appointment for a meeting with Kartal. However, Kartal makes it clear from the very first moment that he is not as easy prey as the Kormans think. Somer's confession to Türkan puts them on an irreversible path. After what she has heard, Türkan decides to walk her path with her baby and fight her struggle alone. While Rüçhan takes action to prove to Somer that Mine is the killer of Türkan's unborn baby, Türkan starts to take steps for her future life with determination and confidence.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-05-23\",\"runtime\":145},{\"number\":35,\"name\":\"Episode 51\",\"overview\":\"Somer and Rüçhan want to surprise Türkan on the occasion of her birthday, but the real surprise comes from Türkan and Kartal. When Nesrin learns about Derya's marriage, she calls Derya home to take her to account for it. However, the result of this harsh argument leads to an unexpected development and Dönüş learns the secret that has been kept from her for years. Not ready to face this reality at that moment, Dönüş disappears. Derya, on the other hand, while she has burned her ships against her family, cannot get out of Sevilay's shadow. Türkan and Kartal's meeting for a business dinner causes jealousy in Somer's front. However, this time the consequences of Somer's impulsive actions reflect not only on him but also on his family. When Türkan learns that Dönüş has disappeared, she begins to search for her sister in fear. Witnessing this, Kartal does not hesitate to lend her a helping hand. Türkan is about to embark on a brand new journey with the question she will ask Kartal.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-05-30\",\"runtime\":146},{\"number\":36,\"name\":\"Episode 52\",\"overview\":\"Türkan does not get the answer she expects from her question to Kartal. However, Kartal has another proposal to keep Türkan and Somer together. After Dönüş confronts her past, she falls into a deep and worrying silence. Derya is uncomfortable with the truth she reveals to Dönüş. On the other hand, as she continues to ignore Sevilay's existence and focus on her own life, the differences between her and Mustafa begin to surface even more. After a hesitation about Kartal, Rüçhan uses Mine as a trump card to reconcile Türkan and Somer as soon as possible. A new development about Türkan's baby causes great surprise among everyone. The end of Dönüş's silence will come with a development that will radically change everyone's lives.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-06-06\",\"runtime\":147},{\"number\":37,\"name\":\"Episode 53\",\"overview\":\"Dönüş is eager to reunite with her past, but the embrace she expects does not come easily. However, Dönüş is determined, she will not give up on her path despite all the consequences. On the other hand, the effects of the book she wrote spread to the whole family. Derya makes a plan for her own life without informing Mustafa. Because of this, she and Mustafa fall out even more bitterly, and she comes to a breaking point with her family because of the truth she reveals to Dönüş. After all she has been through, 